# Nutritional Support Strategies & Bioavailability Matrices
#
# Whole-food matrices, gut barrier integrity, protein kinetics, organ/marine density, and xenohormesis.

#>spw_cache_physio_nutritional_strategies
#:cache #!physio_dev
#:layer #!pragmatics

^"intent"{
  ~#goal: "Model evidence-based nutritional strategies that maximize micronutrient bioavailability, preserve gut barrier integrity, and optimize cellular repair."
  ~#foundations: "Food matrix synergy, intestinal mucosal biology, amino acid threshold kinetics, and Nrf2 xenohormesis"
}

^["whole_food_matrices_and_absorption_kinetics"]{
  food_matrix_principle: "Nutrients ingested within intact whole-food matrices exhibit superior kinetic absorption and cellular incorporation compared to isolated synthetic analogs."
  bioavailability_enhancers: #[
    "Lipid Emulsion for Fat-Solubles: Ingesting Vitamins A, D3, E, and K2 alongside healthy dietary fats (extra virgin olive oil, pastured egg yolks) increases absorption 3-5x",
    "Phytate & Oxalate Reduction: Traditional culinary preparation (overnight soaking, sourdough fermentation, sprouting) deactivates anti-nutrients that bind zinc, iron, and calcium",
    "Ascorbic Acid Iron Coupling: Pairing non-heme plant iron with 50-100 mg of Vitamin C converts ferric (Fe3+) iron into absorbable ferrous (Fe2+) iron"
  ]
}

^["gut_barrier_integrity_and_microbiome_symbiosis"]{
  enterocyte_architecture: "A single-cell monolayer separating luminal pathogens and endotoxins from systemic blood circulation."
  regenerative_protocols: .{
    tight_junction_reinforcement: "L-Glutamine, zinc carnosine, and bovine colostrum fortifying claudin and occludin protein complexes"
    short_chain_fatty_acids: "Bacterial fermentation of prebiotic resistant starch and arabinoxylans yielding butyrate, the primary fuel for colonocytes"
    mucosal_glycocalyx_support: "Bone broths rich in glycine, proline, and hydroxyproline supporting the thick mucin-2 protective gel layer"
    fermented_food_diversity: "Daily ingestion of unpasteurized kefir, kimchi, raw sauerkraut, and natto introducing diverse probiotic consortia"
  }[reg=facet]
}

^["protein_kinetics_and_amino_acid_thresholds"]{
  skeletal_muscle_repair: "Muscle Protein Synthesis (MPS) is not an on/off switch but a threshold-governed intracellular signaling event."
  anabolic_mechanics: #[
    "The Leucine Trigger: Requiring ~2.5 to 3.0 grams of free leucine per meal to activate the Sestrin2 sensor and trigger downstream mTORC1 anabolic cascades",
    "Bolus Distribution: Consuming 30-45 grams of high-quality complete protein across 3-4 distinct meals rather than skimming protein all day",
    "Methionine to Glycine Balancing: Balancing muscle meat (high methionine) with connective tissue and collagen (high glycine) to preserve homocysteine buffering"
  ]
}

^["marine_and_organ_nutrient_density"]{
  ancestral_superfoods: "Foods that pack the highest concentration of bioavailable micronutrients per gram on earth."
  nutritional_profiles: #[
    "Pasture-Raised Beef Liver: Nature's multivitamin delivering preformed Vitamin A (retinol), bioavailable heme iron, active folate, and Vitamin B12",
    "Wild Small Oily Fish (Sardines, Mackerel): Providing bioavailable marine Omega-3s (EPA/DHA), calcium from edible bones, selenium, and CoQ10",
    "Bivalves (Oysters, Mussels): Unrivaled source of chelated zinc, copper, manganese, vitamin B12, and trace marine minerals"
  ]
}

^["phytonutrient_xenohormesis_and_nrf2_activation"]{
  xenohormetic_concept: "Mild chemical stressors produced by plants for defense stimulate robust endogenous antioxidant defenses in human cells."
  potent_compounds: #[
    "Sulforaphane (Broccoli Sprouts): Potent activator of Nrf2, inducing phase-II detoxification enzymes and glutathione synthesis",
    "Anthocyanins (Wild Berries): Crossing the blood-brain barrier to reduce microglial neuroinflammation and enhance cerebral blood flow",
    "Polyphenolic Olive Oil (Oleocanthal): Natural COX-1/COX-2 inhibitor exhibiting anti-inflammatory potency akin to low-dose ibuprofen"
  ]
}

^["taste"]{
  ~#taste: "True nutrition is not a chemistry set of white powders and synthetic capsules; it is the reverent communion with living soil, clean water, and unadulterated food."
  ~#wonder: "Why does the natural matrix of an egg yolk deliver lutein and zeaxanthin to the human retina at five times the efficiency of an equal milligram dose in a pill?"

  principles: #[
    "Bio-intelligibility: Eating foods that human physiology has biochemically recognized and metabolized for hundreds of thousands of years.",
    "Microbial stewardship: Remembering that every meal feeds not just 30 trillion human cells, but 40 trillion microbial allies in the gut.",
    "Pleasure and satiety: Authentic nourishment leaves the eater grounded, joyful, and completely free of erratic sugar cravings."
  ]
}

^"invariants"{
  "Nutritional protocols must prioritize whole-food sources of nutrients before introducing synthetic isolated dietary supplements.",
  "Adequate dietary fat is mandatory for the intestinal absorption of lipophilic vitamins (A, D, E, K).",
  "Protein targets must be calculated based on ideal lean body mass rather than gross total body weight.",
}

#>wonder_physio_nutritional_strategies_1
?["How does replacing industrial ultra-processed foods with ancestral whole foods affect systemic endotoxemia and gut permeability in 30 days?"]{
  #:depth #!biological ~#lens(metabolic_endotoxemia)
  ~#hypothesis: "Switching from a standard Western diet to an unrefined whole-food matrix reduces serum lipopolysaccharide (LPS) levels by 55% and restores normal lactulose-mannitol gut permeability within four weeks."
  !probe{ "Conduct 4-week controlled feeding intervention measuring postprandial serum endotoxin (LPS) and plasma zonulin levels in adults with metabolic syndrome." }
  $%[inflammation.serum_lps_endotoxin, gut.zonulin_plasma_ng_ml]
}
